{"type":"text","timestamp":1791296871848,"sessionID":"ses_eee64f166ffetKE5aG292H35oH","part":{"id":"prt_1119d1360001zEJYfkPLNqOXPR","messageID":"msg_1119d0add001TfAaMPFhhpH8ti","sessionID":"ses_eee64f166ffetKE5aG292H35oH","type":"text","text":"The code is correct there — my assertion had the tie order backwards (`beta` < `gamma` alphabetically, so beta comes first per the docstring). Re-checking with the right expectation:","time":{"start":1791296869216,"end":1791296871846}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791296872004,"sessionID":"ses_eee64f166ffetKE5aG292H35oH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_ad3b425c6ac642b690e7fe88","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nfrom ledger.money import format_cents, parse_amount\nfrom ledger.parse import parse_date, parse_ledger, parse_record\nfrom ledger.report import summary_line, top_items\n\nassert parse_amount(\"0.5\") == 50\nassert parse_amount(\"-$1,234.56\") == -123456\nassert format_cents(-5) == \"-$0.05\"\nassert format_cents(0) == \"$0.00\"\nassert format_cents(-123456) == \"-$1,234.56\"\nassert format_cents(5) == \"$0.05\"\nassert parse_date(\"2026-01-31\") == (2026, 1, 31)\n\nrecs = parse_ledger(\"\"\"\n2026-10-01 | Alpha | 1 | $2.00\n2026-10-02 | beta  |  2 | $1.00\n   # indented comment line\n\n2026-10-03 |gamma| 1 | $2.00\n2026-10-04 | ALPHA | 1 | $2.00\n\"\"\")\n# tie beta/gamma at 200 -> name ascending: beta first\nassert top_items(recs, 3) == [(\"alpha\", 400), (\"beta\", 200), (\"gamma\", 200)]\nassert top_items(recs, 10) == top_items(recs, 3)\nassert top_items(recs, 0) == []\nassert summary_line(recs) == \"alpha=$4.00; beta=$2.00; gamma=$2.00\"\nassert summary_line(recs, 1) == \"alpha=$4.00\"\nrec = parse_record(\" 2026-10-06 | Widget | 3 | $4.50 \")\nassert rec == {\"date\": (2026, 10, 6), \"item\": \"widget\", \"qty\": 3, \"unit_cents\": 450}\nprint(\"all documented-behaviour checks passed\")\nEOF"},"output":"all documented-behaviour checks passed\n","metadata":{"output":"all documented-behaviour checks passed\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nfrom ledger.money import format_cents, parse_amount\nfrom ledger.parse import parse_date, parse_ledger, parse_record\nfrom ledger.report import summary_line, top_items\n\nassert parse_amount(\"0.5\") == 50\nassert parse_amount(\"-$1,234.56\") == -123456\nassert format_cents(-5) == \"-$0.05\"\nassert format_cents(0) == \"$0.00\"\nassert format_cents(-123456) == \"-$1,234.56\"\nassert format_cents(5) == \"$0.05\"\nassert parse_date(\"2026-01-31\") == (2026, 1, 31)\n\nrecs = parse_ledger(\"\"\"\n2026-10-01 | Alpha | 1 | $2.00\n2026-10-02 | beta  |  2 | $1.00\n   # indented comment line\n\n2026-10-03 |gamma| 1 | $2.00\n2026-10-04 | ALPHA | 1 | $2.00\n\"\"\")\n# tie beta/gamma at 200 -> name ascending: beta first\nassert top_items(recs, 3) == [(\"alpha\", 400), (\"beta\", 200), (\"gamma\", 200)]\nassert top_items(recs, 10) == top_items(recs, 3)\nassert top_items(recs, 0) == []\nassert summary_line(recs) == \"alpha=$4.00; beta=$2.00; gamma=$2.00\"\nassert summary_line(recs, 1) == \"alpha=$4.00\"\nrec = parse_record(\" 2026-10-06 | Widget | 3 | $4.50 \")\nassert rec == {\"date\": (2026, 10, 6), \"item\": \"widget\", \"qty\": 3, \"unit_cents\": 450}\nprint(\"all documented-behaviour checks passed\")\nEOF","time":{"start":1791296871842,"end":1791296871987}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"My assertion was wrong, not the code: I asserted `[(\"alpha\", 400), (\"gamma\", 200), (\"beta\", 200)]` but beta=2×$1.00=200 and gamma=1×$2.00=200 — tie between beta and gamma, broken by name ascending → beta before gamma. The code returned `[(\"alpha\", 400), (\"beta\", 200), (\"gamma\", 200)]`, which is exactly correct per the docstring: \"Order is by total descending; ties are broken by item name ascending.\"\n\nSo the code is right; my hand-written expectation had the tie order backwards. Let me correct the check and re-run to confirm everything, including the summary_line default-n expectation (\"alpha=$4.00; beta=$2.00; gamma=$2.00\").","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1119d143a001MzpG0RRVSor101","sessionID":"ses_eee64f166ffetKE5aG292H35oH","messageID":"msg_1119d0add001TfAaMPFhhpH8ti"}}
